.TH GETPPID 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
getppid \- returns the parent process id
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B pid_t getppid(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Returns the parent process ID.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the value described above; errno is not modified.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR getppid (2)
